# hangedman_zot_diagonal_lockstep keeps its authored Zot geometry and source selectors.
# Named Lua hooks below perform only the source decisions that
# cannot remain static DES directives.
# Source: crawl-ref/source/dat/des/branches/zot.des.
NAME:    hangedman_zot_diagonal_lockstep
TAGS:    transparent extra decor
DEPTH:   Zot
ITEM:    % no_pickup
KFEAT:   Z = zot trap
SHUFFLE: ABCDEFG, defg / hijk / mnop / qrst, defg, hjik, mnop
SUBST:   A : xbvcZ, B : xbvc, C : xxbvc, D : xxbvc, EFG = x
SUBST:   d : xxZ, h = x, e : xx., i : xx., f : x.., j : x.., m : x..
SUBST:   gknopqrst = .
: vault.run("choose_depth_stairs")
# Source Lua: :  if you.depth() == dgn.br_depth(you.branch()) then
# Source Lua: SUBST:  { = {([ <:5 Z:5
# Source Lua: :  elseif you.depth() == "1" then
# Source Lua: SUBST:  { = {:40 })]> d:20 Z:20
# Source Lua: :  else
# Source Lua: SUBST:  { = {([<})]> d:20 Z:20
# Source Lua: :  end
MAP
             Dq...iC
        .....rD...Ch..
        .......x.x...p
        ...mF...x...o.
       Es..F...x.x....
 ......tE.x..kx...x..eB
 ........x...Cj....x.xd
A..fB...x.x.....G...x..
.A.xg.nG...{...Gn.gx.A.
..x...G.....x.x...Bf..A
dx.x....jC...x........
Be..x...Ck..x.Et......
 ....x.x...F..sE
 .o...x...Fm...
 p...x.x.......
 ..hC...Dr.....
   Ci...qD
ENDMAP
